## Interface: 16001
## AllowLoadGameType: forever
## ExcludeLoadGameType: standard, classic
## Title: Lunchbox Toolkit — Vendor
## IconTexture: Interface\AddOns\LunchboxToolkit\Media\Inv_treasurechest_felfirecitadel_64
## Notes: Levelling helper for the bags. Marks the one cheapest item to lose (total stack value), sells grey junk at a merchant only when switched on, and flags surplus upgrade gear for gold framing. Never destroys, moves or equips anything. Commands: /lt vendor, with /lbv and /ltvendor as aliases. The auto-sell and surplus switches are saved per character; the ignore list is per account.
## Author: Lunchbox
## Version: 1.0.0
## Dependencies: LunchboxToolkit
## SavedVariables: LunchboxToolkitVendorDB
## X-Category: Character Advancement

